# Hybrid Monitor LUT
# Profile  : Blackmagic Film Gen 5
# Cameras  : Pocket 6K G2, 6K Pro, 6K G2, URSA Mini Pro 12K
# Input    : Blackmagic Film Gen 5 log / Blackmagic Wide Gamut
# Output   : Rec.709 base + narrow exposure tracer overlays
# Generator: hybrid_monitor_lut.py
#
# Base transform pipeline:
#   Log decode  →  Blackmagic Wide Gamut → Rec.709 matrix  →  Rec.709 OETF
#
# Overlay zones (thin tracers over Rec.709 base):
#   #ef4444     white_clip      log 0.750 – 1.000
#   #eab308     +2 stops        log 0.498 – 0.506
#   #d946ef     +1 stops        log 0.438 – 0.447
#   #22c55e     +0 stops        log 0.379 – 0.388
#   #06b6d4     -1 stops        log 0.322 – 0.330
#   #3b82f6     -2 stops        log 0.267 – 0.274
#   #6366f1     black_clip      log 0.000 – 0.100
#   All other levels → standard Rec.709 color (no tracer)
#
TITLE "HybridMonitor Blackmagic Film Gen 5"
LUT_3D_SIZE 33
